<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #333;
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .header {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667EEA 0%, #764BA2 100%);
                color: white;
                padding: 30px;
                text-align: center;
                border-radius: 10px 0;
            }
            .content {
                background: #F9F9F9;
                padding: 30px;
                border-radius: 0 10px;
            }
            .button {
                display: inline-block;
                padding: 15px 30px;
                background: #667EEA;
                color: #FFF;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 5px;
                margin: 20px 0;
                font-weight: bold;
            }
            .footer {
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 30px;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #666;
            }
        </style>
        <title></title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to Certibot!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong>{{ user.username }}</strong>,</p>

            <p>Thank you for registering on Certibot, your training assistant for the Symfony certification.</p>

            <p>To activate your account and start training, please click the button below to verify your email address:</p>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" class="button">Check my email</a>
            </div>

            <p>If the button doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
            <p style="word-break: break-all; background: #FFF; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px;">{{ verificationUrl }}</p>

            <p><strong>Note:</strong> This link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons.</p>

            <p>If you have not created an account on CertiBot, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

            <p>See you soon on CertiBot!<br/> CertiBot Team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} CertiBot. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>This email was sent automatically, please do not reply to it.</p>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>